WEBVTT

00:31:58.998 --> 00:32:00.573
Is it a matter of writing checks?

00:32:00.597 --> 00:32:02.324
And so, the whole thing seemed wrong

00:32:02.348 --> 00:32:06.923
because so many Americans have no history
in their family of perpetrating slavery.

00:32:06.947 --> 00:32:08.596
Maybe they're immigrants who came.

00:32:08.620 --> 00:32:10.823
It seemed like a completely
impractical idea.

00:32:10.847 --> 00:32:13.113
But over time,
as I've seen the crisis grow,

00:32:13.137 --> 00:32:15.149
I've seen society divide.

00:32:15.173 --> 00:32:18.323
I've seen our politics overline
with our racial divisions,

00:32:18.347 --> 00:32:21.149
which seems, to me, poisonously dangerous.

00:32:21.173 --> 00:32:23.852
And we've seen the rise
of white ethnic nationalism.

00:32:23.876 --> 00:32:25.908
It's sort of radicalized my view.

00:32:25.932 --> 00:32:28.516
And I don't think reparations
should be a guilt payment

00:32:28.540 --> 00:32:30.288
from white people to black people.